&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Balance execution and strategy: translate a long-term vision for the platform&#39;s core into a prioritized, well-sequenced roadmap that Engineering can execute against.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
